#. module: stock_picking_report_printed_flag
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_picking_report_printed_flag.field_stock_picking__printed_report_names
msgid ""
"Comma-separated list of printed report names, computed from related printed "
"logs. Only active if enabled in configuration."
msgstr ""
"Elenco, separato da virgole, dei nomi dei resoconti stampati, calcolati a "
"partire dai relativi registri di stampa. Attivo solo se abilitato nella "
"configurazione."

#. module: stock_picking_report_printed_flag
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:stock_picking_report_printed_flag.field_stock_picking__printed
msgid ""
"Indicates whether at least one configured report has been printed for this "
"record."
msgstr ""
"Indica se per questo record è stato stampato almeno un resoconto configurato."

